{
  "manifest_version": 1,
  "type": "device",
  "name": "Rhasspy",
  "description": {
    "en": "Your Rhasspy 2.5 voice intents trigger Gladys scenes, and Gladys makes Rhasspy speak.",
    "fr": "Les intentions vocales de Rhasspy 2.5 lancent vos scènes Gladys, et Gladys fait parler Rhasspy.",
    "de": "Die Sprach-Intents von Rhasspy 2.5 starten deine Gladys-Szenen, und Gladys lässt Rhasspy sprechen.",
    "es": "Las intenciones de voz de Rhasspy 2.5 lanzan sus escenas Gladys, y Gladys hace hablar a Rhasspy."
  },
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "docker_image": "ghcr.io/guim31/gladys-rhasspy:1.0.0",
  "gladys_version": ">=5.2.0",
  "cover_image": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/guim31/gladys-rhasspy/main/cover.png",
  "categories": ["assistants"],
  "transports": ["local"],
  "config_schema": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "type": "section",
      "label": {
        "en": "Connect Rhasspy",
        "fr": "Connecter Rhasspy",
        "de": "Rhasspy verbinden",
        "es": "Conectar Rhasspy"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Rhasspy 2.5 talks over MQTT (Hermes protocol). In Rhasspy, Settings → MQTT: choose External and enter the same broker as here, or use its internal broker (port 12183). Intent Handling can stay disabled.",
        "fr": "Rhasspy 2.5 communique par MQTT (protocole Hermes). Dans Rhasspy, Settings → MQTT : choisissez External et indiquez le même broker qu'ici, ou utilisez son broker interne (port 12183). Intent Handling peut rester désactivé.",
        "de": "Rhasspy 2.5 kommuniziert über MQTT (Hermes-Protokoll). In Rhasspy, Settings → MQTT: Wähle External und gib denselben Broker wie hier ein, oder nutze seinen internen Broker (Port 12183). Intent Handling kann deaktiviert bleiben.",
        "es": "Rhasspy 2.5 se comunica por MQTT (protocolo Hermes). En Rhasspy, Settings → MQTT: elija External e indique el mismo broker que aquí, o use su broker interno (puerto 12183). Intent Handling puede quedar desactivado."
      },
      "links": [
        {
          "url": "https://rhasspy.readthedocs.io/en/latest/reference/#mqtt-api",
          "label": {
            "en": "Rhasspy MQTT API",
            "fr": "API MQTT de Rhasspy",
            "de": "MQTT-API von Rhasspy",
            "es": "API MQTT de Rhasspy"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "broker_url",
      "type": "string",
      "required": true,
      "label": {
        "en": "MQTT broker",
        "fr": "Broker MQTT",
        "de": "MQTT-Broker",
        "es": "Broker MQTT"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "The broker Rhasspy publishes its intents on.",
        "fr": "Le broker sur lequel Rhasspy publie ses intentions.",
        "de": "Der Broker, auf dem Rhasspy seine Intents veröffentlicht.",
        "es": "El broker en el que Rhasspy publica sus intenciones."
      },
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "e.g. mqtt://rhasspy.local:1883",
        "fr": "ex. mqtt://rhasspy.local:1883",
        "de": "z. B. mqtt://rhasspy.local:1883",
        "es": "p. ej. mqtt://rhasspy.local:1883"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "username",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "MQTT user name",
        "fr": "Utilisateur MQTT",
        "de": "MQTT-Benutzername",
        "es": "Usuario MQTT"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "type": "secret",
      "label": {
        "en": "MQTT password",
        "fr": "Mot de passe MQTT",
        "de": "MQTT-Passwort",
        "es": "Contraseña MQTT"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "tls_insecure",
      "type": "boolean",
      "default": false,
      "label": {
        "en": "Accept a self-signed certificate (mqtts://)",
        "fr": "Accepter un certificat auto-signé (mqtts://)",
        "de": "Selbstsigniertes Zertifikat akzeptieren (mqtts://)",
        "es": "Aceptar un certificado autofirmado (mqtts://)"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "api_url",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "Rhasspy web address (optional)",
        "fr": "Adresse web de Rhasspy (facultatif)",
        "de": "Webadresse von Rhasspy (optional)",
        "es": "Dirección web de Rhasspy (opcional)"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Adds a server device: reachable, version, profile language. Not needed for intents and speech.",
        "fr": "Ajoute un appareil serveur : joignable, version, langue du profil. Inutile pour les intentions et la parole.",
        "de": "Fügt ein Server-Gerät hinzu: erreichbar, Version, Sprache des Profils. Für Intents und Sprache nicht nötig.",
        "es": "Añade un dispositivo servidor: accesible, versión, idioma del perfil. No hace falta para intenciones y voz."
      },
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "e.g. http://rhasspy.local:12101",
        "fr": "ex. http://rhasspy.local:12101",
        "de": "z. B. http://rhasspy.local:12101",
        "es": "p. ej. http://rhasspy.local:12101"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "default_site",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "default",
      "label": {
        "en": "Default site",
        "fr": "Site par défaut",
        "de": "Standard-Site",
        "es": "Site predeterminado"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "The site id that speaks when a scene does not name one (Rhasspy: Settings → siteId).",
        "fr": "Le siteId qui parle quand une scène n'en précise pas (Rhasspy : Settings → siteId).",
        "de": "Die Site-ID, die spricht, wenn eine Szene keine angibt (Rhasspy: Settings → siteId).",
        "es": "El siteId que habla cuando una escena no indica ninguno (Rhasspy: Settings → siteId)."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "sites",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "Listened sites (optional)",
        "fr": "Sites écoutés (facultatif)",
        "de": "Gehörte Sites (optional)",
        "es": "Sites escuchados (opcional)"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Site ids separated by commas. Empty: every site.",
        "fr": "siteIds séparés par des virgules. Vide : tous les sites.",
        "de": "Site-IDs, durch Kommas getrennt. Leer: alle Sites.",
        "es": "siteIds separados por comas. Vacío: todos los sites."
      },
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "e.g. default, kitchen",
        "fr": "ex. default, cuisine",
        "de": "z. B. default, kueche",
        "es": "p. ej. default, cocina"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "language",
      "type": "select",
      "default": "fr",
      "label": {
        "en": "Language of the names",
        "fr": "Langue des noms",
        "de": "Sprache der Namen",
        "es": "Idioma de los nombres"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Names of the devices and texts sent by the integration.",
        "fr": "Noms des appareils et textes envoyés par l'intégration.",
        "de": "Namen der Geräte und Texte der Integration.",
        "es": "Nombres de los dispositivos y textos de la integración."
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "en",
          "label": {
            "en": "English",
            "fr": "Anglais",
            "de": "Englisch",
            "es": "Inglés"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "fr",
          "label": {
            "en": "French",
            "fr": "Français",
            "de": "Französisch",
            "es": "Francés"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "de",
          "label": {
            "en": "German",
            "fr": "Allemand",
            "de": "Deutsch",
            "es": "Alemán"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "es",
          "label": {
            "en": "Spanish",
            "fr": "Espagnol",
            "de": "Spanisch",
            "es": "Español"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "actions": [
    {
      "key": "check_connection",
      "timeout_seconds": 15,
      "label": {
        "en": "Check the connection",
        "fr": "Vérifier la connexion",
        "de": "Verbindung prüfen",
        "es": "Comprobar la conexión"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Tells whether the MQTT broker and the Rhasspy web address answer.",
        "fr": "Indique si le broker MQTT et l'adresse web de Rhasspy répondent.",
        "de": "Zeigt, ob der MQTT-Broker und die Webadresse von Rhasspy antworten.",
        "es": "Indica si el broker MQTT y la dirección web de Rhasspy responden."
      }
    }
  ],
  "scene_triggers": [
    {
      "key": "intent_recognized",
      "label": {
        "en": "Rhasspy: intent recognized",
        "fr": "Rhasspy : intention reconnue",
        "de": "Rhasspy: Intent erkannt",
        "es": "Rhasspy: intención reconocida"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Rhasspy recognized a sentence. Filter by intent, site and slot values (slots sorted by name); leave empty for any.",
        "fr": "Rhasspy a reconnu une phrase. Filtrez par intention, site et valeurs des slots (triés par nom) ; vide = tous.",
        "de": "Rhasspy hat einen Satz erkannt. Filtere nach Intent, Site und Slot-Werten (nach Name sortiert); leer = alle.",
        "es": "Rhasspy reconoció una frase. Filtre por intención, site y valores de slots (ordenados por nombre); vacío = todos."
      },
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "intent",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Intent (exact name)",
            "fr": "Intention (nom exact)",
            "de": "Intent (genauer Name)",
            "es": "Intención (nombre exacto)"
          },
          "placeholder": {
            "en": "e.g. ChangeLightState",
            "fr": "ex. ChangeLightState",
            "de": "z. B. ChangeLightState",
            "es": "p. ej. ChangeLightState"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "site_id",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Site (siteId)",
            "fr": "Site (siteId)",
            "de": "Site (siteId)",
            "es": "Site (siteId)"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "Empty: any site.",
            "fr": "Vide : n'importe quel site.",
            "de": "Leer: jede Site.",
            "es": "Vacío: cualquier site."
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "slot_1_value",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Slot 1 value",
            "fr": "Valeur du slot 1",
            "de": "Wert von Slot 1",
            "es": "Valor del slot 1"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "slot_2_value",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Slot 2 value",
            "fr": "Valeur du slot 2",
            "de": "Wert von Slot 2",
            "es": "Valor del slot 2"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "slot_3_value",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Slot 3 value",
            "fr": "Valeur du slot 3",
            "de": "Wert von Slot 3",
            "es": "Valor del slot 3"
          }
        }
      ],
      "variables": [
        {
          "key": "intent",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Intent",
            "fr": "Intention",
            "de": "Intent",
            "es": "Intención"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "site_id",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Site",
            "fr": "Site",
            "de": "Site",
            "es": "Site"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "text",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Sentence heard",
            "fr": "Phrase entendue",
            "de": "Gehörter Satz",
            "es": "Frase oída"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "confidence",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Confidence (%)",
            "fr": "Confiance (%)",
            "de": "Konfidenz (%)",
            "es": "Confianza (%)"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "slots",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "All slots",
            "fr": "Tous les slots",
            "de": "Alle Slots",
            "es": "Todos los slots"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "slot_1_name",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Slot 1: name",
            "fr": "Slot 1 : nom",
            "de": "Slot 1: Name",
            "es": "Slot 1: nombre"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "slot_1_value",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Slot 1: value",
            "fr": "Slot 1 : valeur",
            "de": "Slot 1: Wert",
            "es": "Slot 1: valor"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "slot_2_name",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Slot 2: name",
            "fr": "Slot 2 : nom",
            "de": "Slot 2: Name",
            "es": "Slot 2: nombre"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "slot_2_value",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Slot 2: value",
            "fr": "Slot 2 : valeur",
            "de": "Slot 2: Wert",
            "es": "Slot 2: valor"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "slot_3_name",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Slot 3: name",
            "fr": "Slot 3 : nom",
            "de": "Slot 3: Name",
            "es": "Slot 3: nombre"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "slot_3_value",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Slot 3: value",
            "fr": "Slot 3 : valeur",
            "de": "Slot 3: Wert",
            "es": "Slot 3: valor"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "intent_not_recognized",
      "label": {
        "en": "Rhasspy: sentence not recognized",
        "fr": "Rhasspy : phrase non reconnue",
        "de": "Rhasspy: Satz nicht erkannt",
        "es": "Rhasspy: frase no reconocida"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Rhasspy heard a sentence that matches no intent.",
        "fr": "Rhasspy a entendu une phrase qui ne correspond à aucune intention.",
        "de": "Rhasspy hat einen Satz gehört, der zu keinem Intent passt.",
        "es": "Rhasspy oyó una frase que no corresponde a ninguna intención."
      },
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "site_id",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Site (siteId)",
            "fr": "Site (siteId)",
            "de": "Site (siteId)",
            "es": "Site (siteId)"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "Empty: any site.",
            "fr": "Vide : n'importe quel site.",
            "de": "Leer: jede Site.",
            "es": "Vacío: cualquier site."
          }
        }
      ],
      "variables": [
        {
          "key": "site_id",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Site",
            "fr": "Site",
            "de": "Site",
            "es": "Site"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "text",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Sentence heard",
            "fr": "Phrase entendue",
            "de": "Gehörter Satz",
            "es": "Frase oída"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "scene_actions": [
    {
      "key": "say",
      "timeout_seconds": 40,
      "label": {
        "en": "Rhasspy: say a text",
        "fr": "Rhasspy : dire un texte",
        "de": "Rhasspy: Text sagen",
        "es": "Rhasspy: decir un texto"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Rhasspy speaks the text on a site, with its own text-to-speech.",
        "fr": "Rhasspy prononce le texte sur un site, avec sa propre synthèse vocale.",
        "de": "Rhasspy spricht den Text auf einer Site, mit seiner eigenen Sprachausgabe.",
        "es": "Rhasspy pronuncia el texto en un site, con su propia síntesis de voz."
      },
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "text",
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "label": {
            "en": "Text",
            "fr": "Texte",
            "de": "Text",
            "es": "Texto"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "site_id",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Site (siteId)",
            "fr": "Site (siteId)",
            "de": "Site (siteId)",
            "es": "Site (siteId)"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "Empty: the default site of the configuration.",
            "fr": "Vide : le site par défaut de la configuration.",
            "de": "Leer: die Standard-Site der Konfiguration.",
            "es": "Vacío: el site predeterminado de la configuración."
          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "site_id",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Site",
            "fr": "Site",
            "de": "Site",
            "es": "Site"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "key": "recent_intents",
      "icon": "mic",
      "label": {
        "en": "Rhasspy: recent intents",
        "fr": "Rhasspy : intentions",
        "de": "Rhasspy: Intents",
        "es": "Rhasspy: intenciones"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "The last sentences Rhasspy heard, and a button to make it speak.",
        "fr": "Les dernières phrases entendues par Rhasspy, et un bouton pour le faire parler.",
        "de": "Die letzten von Rhasspy gehörten Sätze und ein Knopf, um es sprechen zu lassen.",
        "es": "Las últimas frases oídas por Rhasspy y un botón para hacerlo hablar."
      },
      "settings": [
        {
          "key": "site",
          "type": "select",
          "source": "devices",
          "label": {
            "en": "Only this site",
            "fr": "Seulement ce site",
            "de": "Nur diese Site",
            "es": "Solo este site"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "hide_not_recognized",
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": false,
          "label": {
            "en": "Hide sentences not recognized",
            "fr": "Masquer les phrases non reconnues",
            "de": "Nicht erkannte Sätze ausblenden",
            "es": "Ocultar las frases no reconocidas"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "hide_say_button",
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": false,
          "label": {
            "en": "Hide the speak button",
            "fr": "Masquer le bouton de parole",
            "de": "Sprechknopf ausblenden",
            "es": "Ocultar el botón de voz"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
